# Kinexis Digital - Frontend

## Quick rules
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` first if unsure.
- Use `@/*` imports. Follow existing patterns in neighboring files.
- Reuse components from `src/components/` and `src/components/ui.tsx`. Don't rebuild existing UI.
- Follow `docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md` (sticker/navy/orange/cobalt, hard shadows). Use existing button/card styles.
- Don't invent claims/pricing - use `docs/CONTENT.md` and repo sources.
- Preserve responsive/layout/accessibility. Use Tailwind patterns already in use.
- Don't add deps without clear need. Don't modify unrelated files.
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run typecheck` for relevant changes; fix errors you introduce.
- For visuals, prefer `Art`/`ArtDecor`/`Icon`/`Illustration` from `src/components/ui.tsx`/`artwork.tsx`.
- Images: `next/image` is unoptimized; use existing image patterns.
